# Clipboard test (needs python3 + PySide6): the script's text is offered through wl_data_device, Ctrl+V pastes it into the line edit.
Window gui
Size 700x500
Run python3 -I ${AUTODEMO_ROOT}/qtapp.py
WaitFor title "qt:ready" 30s
WaitFor settle 300ms 10s
MouseMove 350 421 300
MouseClick
Clipboard "from the script"
SendKey C-v
WaitFor title "qt:text=from the script" 10s
Clipboard "second text"
SendKey C-a C-v
WaitFor title "qt:text=second text" 10s
Sleep 300ms
